<title>JAPAN: Jidosha Denki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Jidosha Denki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.86		vs	   24.47</p>
<p> Operating	  350    million    vs	  424    million</p>
<p> Current	    599    million    vs	  583    million</p>
<p> Net		  232    million    vs	  215    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.73 yen	  vs	    8.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  25 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Jidosha Denki Kogyo Co Ltd is an automobile control parts maker.</p>
</text>
